d (vs planned 250).\n\n## Your Review Task\n\nWrite a detailed review focusing on:\n\n### A. Methods Evaluation\n1. Is the Interaction Index (II) well-defined and appropriate? Any issues with the formulation?\n2. Is quantile-based phase segmentation principled or ad hoc? Does it actually capture meaningful reasoning stages?\n3. Is the statistical framework appropriate (Wilcoxon, Bonferroni, bootstrap)?\n4. Are there confounds the paired design does NOT control for?\n5. Is the \"discrimination collapse\" mechanism sufficiently validated or just correlational?\n\n### B. Experiments Evaluation\n1. Are the experimental conditions comprehensive enough? Missing conditions?\n2. Is n=500 / n=250 / n=50 adequate for the claims made?\n3. Is the head pruning ratio p fixed or varied? (Note: paper mentions p but never specifies its value!)\n4. Are baselines/comparisons adequate? What's missing?\n5. How well do GPQA results support/undermine the claims?\n6. Is the pilot mitigation study adequate (n=50, pre-registered gate not met)?\n7. Any concerns about reproducibility?\n\n### C. Detailed Scoring\nProvide scores with justification for: Soundness, Excitement, Overall Assessment, Confidence.\n\n### D. Summary\n- 3 strengths (bullet points)\n- 3+ weaknesses (bullet points)  \n- Questions for authors (numbered)\n- Missing experiments or analyses\n\nWrite your review in full detail. Be rigorous but fair."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MEt44HPbFSnzxSP94rba8J","session_id":"f803c3f7-d0f1-4587-9cc5-4b6689d0c433","uuid":"094f1f36-93f0-417e-9700-662f3e7bab1a","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:57:34.570Z"}
